Parity with web/src/features/dashboard/widgets/FSMDistributionWidget.tsx:
  - States loading(Skeleton) / error(QueryError->ErrorDisplay+retry) / empty("No state data") / stale(auto-refresh) /
    offline(cached + offline chip) reproduced; plus the two web bodies: compact current-state hero and standard
    donut + legend + recent-transitions feed.
  - Data: shared useVehicles (default = first vehicle id) + useFSMStats (GET /fsm/stats?vehicle_id=) +
    useFSMTransitions(id,'vehicle',24,1,5) (GET /fsm/transitions...), decoded from raw JSON; merged freshness
    (max updatedAt; OR of fetching/stale/error) via FSMDistributionProjection.foldState (stats primary).
  - Donut: buildSegments filters value>0, percent = value/total*100, sorted desc by time-in-state; Canvas ring
    innerR 55% / outerR 80% / 2deg gap (web Pie). State colors mapped to tokens (driving->status.info cyan,
    charging->status.success green, asleep->chart.power purple #A855F7, idle->status.warning amber,
    offline/unknown->onSurfaceVariant) — the web STATE_COLORS table, token-based (no raw hex in render code).
  - Legend: FlowRow of (dot + capitalized state + fmtInt(pct)%). Transitions feed: Recent Transitions header +
    rows of [from badge] -> [to badge] + relative time; compact slices 3, standard slices 5 (web slice(0, n)).
  - fmtDuration reproduces the web Math.floor hours / Math.round minutes ("{m}m" or "{h}h {m}m").
  - Registry: id "fsm-distribution", category "analytics", default 2x4, min 1x2, max 4x40 (FSMDistributionRegistration).
  - i18n: translation_widget_fsmDistribution_{title,recentTransitions,noData,hr,min} (all already present in the
    S10 catalog res/values*) + translation_common_{loading,refresh,retry,offline} + translation_error_serverError_*
    + translation_freshness_* relative formatter. State labels use the web dynamic-key fallback (capitalized raw
    state, since the catalog has no widget.fsmDistribution.state.* entries). No hardcoded English in native code.
  - Diagnostics: view.opened with slug=FSMDistributionWidget (PII-safe, emitted exactly once).
  - Accessibility: refresh control + donut + legend items + transition rows + compact hero carry contentDescription;
    relative-time chip localized; min 44dp touch/row targets.

